- `cell2mat(ptake)` converts the cell array `ptake` into a numeric matrix.
- `quantities = ptakeNumeric(:, 1:end-1)` extracts the material quantities (all columns except the last one).
- `totalCosts = ptakeNumeric(:, end)` extracts the total cost

